plc/north-carolina/moore-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. On the middle, November to December 2025 came in at 43% of normal, and March to April 2026 so far sits at 30%. Grid 18801 had its driest year in 1986 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
